#. type: Plain text
#: pl_editor.adoc:226
msgid "For example, `Size: ${PAPER}` displays \"Size: A4\" when the paper size is set to A4."
msgstr "例如，`Size: ${PAPER}` 在纸张大小设置为 A4 时显示 \"Size: A4\"。"

#. type: Plain text
#: pl_editor.adoc:234
msgid ""
"When the Preview display mode is active (image:images/icons/pagelayout_normal_view_mode_24.png[]), the title block is displayed like in the Schematic and PCB Editors, with keywords replaced with the corresponding values. You can "
"configure the displayed values in the Page Preview Settings dialog (image:images/icons/sheetset_24.png[])."
msgstr ""
"当预览显示模式激活时 (image:images/icons/pagelayout_normal_view_mode_24.png[])，标题块的显示方式与原理图编辑器和 PCB 编辑器中的显示方式相同，其中关键词会被对应的值替换。您可以在“页面预览设置”对话框中配置显示的值 (image:images/icons/"
"sheetset_24.png[])。"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: pl_editor.adoc:235
#, no-wrap
msgid "images/show_fields_edit.png"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: pl_editor.adoc:240
msgid "When the Edit mode is active (image:images/icons/pagelayout_special_view_mode_24.png[]), the title block is displayed without replacing keywords."
msgstr "当编辑模式处于活动状态时 (image:images/icons/pagelayout_special_view_mode_24.png[])，标题块将显示而不替换关键词。"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: pl_editor.adoc:241
#, no-wrap
msgid "images/show_fields_preview.png"
