#. type: Title ==
#: pl_editor.adoc:296
#, no-wrap
msgid "Constraints"
msgstr "约束条件"

#. type: Title ===
#: pl_editor.adoc:299
#, no-wrap
msgid "Page 1 constraint"
msgstr "第 1 页约束条件"

#. type: Plain text
#: pl_editor.adoc:302
msgid "When using the Schematic Editor, the full schematic often uses more than one page."
msgstr "在使用原理图编辑器时，完整的原理图往往会用到一页以上。"

#. type: Plain text
#: pl_editor.adoc:308
msgid ""
"Usually drawing sheet items are shown on all pages, but you can also set each item to be shown only on the first page or on all pages except the first page.  To change which pages an item is shown on, use the dropdown in the the item's "
"**Item Properties** panel. Options are **show on all pages**, **first page only**, and **subsequent pages only**."
msgstr ""
"通常，绘图表中的项目会显示在所有页面上，但您也可以设置每个项目仅在第一页显示，或在除第一页外的所有页面显示。  要更改项目显示的页面，请使用项目属性面板中的下拉菜单。可选项包括 **显示在所有页面上**、**仅显示在第一页** 和 **仅显示在后续页面"
"上**。"

#. type: Plain text
#: pl_editor.adoc:310
msgid "image:images/page_options.png[]"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: pl_editor.adoc:314
#, no-wrap
msgid "Text maximum size constraint"
msgstr "文本最大长度限制"

#. type: Plain text
#: pl_editor.adoc:319
msgid "Text items have a maximum size constraint. You can set a **maximum height** and **maximum width**, which together form a bounding box defining the maximum size of the text object."
msgstr "文本项具有最大尺寸限制。您可以设置 **最大高度** 和 **最大宽度**，这两者共同构成一个边界框，用于定义文本对象的最大尺寸。"

#. type: Plain text
#: pl_editor.adoc:321
msgid "image:images/text_max_size_options.png[]"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: pl_editor.adoc:326
msgid ""
"If the text object is bigger than the maximum size in a given dimension, the text object will be dynamically compressed in that dimension in order to fit within the bounding box. This will result in the text being visually distorted.  If "
"the text fits within the bounding box, the text will not be compressed."
msgstr "如果文本对象在某个维度上的大小超过了最大限制，该文本对象将在该维度上进行动态压缩，以使其能够适应边界框。这将导致文本在视觉上出现变形。  如果文本能够适应边界框，则不会进行压缩。"

#. type: Plain text
#: pl_editor.adoc:329
msgid "When either parameter is set to `0`, KiCad will not enforce a maximum size in that dimension."
msgstr "当任一参数设置为 `0` 时，KiCad 将不会对该维度的最大尺寸进行限制。"

#. type: Plain text
#: pl_editor.adoc:331
msgid "Some text with the maximum height and width set to `0`:"
msgstr "一些文本，其最大高度和宽度均设置为 `0`："

#. type: Plain text
#: pl_editor.adoc:333
msgid "image:images/text_no_max_width.png[]"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: pl_editor.adoc:336
msgid "The same text compressed because the maximum width is set smaller than the width of the text:"
msgstr "由于最大宽度设置得比文本宽度小，因此文本被压缩："

#. type: Plain text
#: pl_editor.adoc:338
msgid "image:images/text_max_width.png[]"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: pl_editor.adoc:340
#, no-wrap
msgid "Invoking the Drawing Sheet Editor"
msgstr "调用图框编辑器"

#. type: Plain text
#: pl_editor.adoc:344
msgid "The Drawing Sheet Editor is typically invoked from a command line, or from the KiCad Project Manager."
msgstr "图框编辑器通常从命令行或 KiCad 工程管理器中调用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: pl_editor.adoc:346
msgid "From a command line, the syntax is pl_editor <*.kicad_wks file to open>."
msgstr "在命令行中，语法为 pl_editor <要打开的 *.kicad_wks 文件>。"

